AltoMintMarket::claimInterest()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
├── when feeRecipient is zero
│   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketInvalidInput
├── when interest is greater than claimableFeesAssets
│   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketInvalidInput
├── when caller is not owner nor feeRecipient
│   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketUnauthorized
├── when interest passed in is zero
│   ├── given caller is owner
│   │   ├── it should mint full claimableFeesAssets to feeRecipient
│   │   ├── it should set claimableFeesAssets to zero
│   │   ├── it should emit InterestClaimed with full amount
│   │   └── it should return full amount
│   └── given caller is feeRecipient
│       ├── it should mint full claimableFeesAssets to feeRecipient
│       ├── it should set claimableFeesAssets to zero
│       ├── it should emit InterestClaimed with full amount
│       └── it should return full amount
└── when interest passed in is non-zero and <= claimableFeesAssets
    ├── given caller is owner
    │   ├── it should mint `interest` to feeRecipient
    │   ├── it should decrease claimableFeesAssets by `interest`
    │   ├── it should emit InterestClaimed with `interest`
    │   └── it should return `interest`
    ├── given caller is feeRecipient
        ├── it should mint `interest` to feeRecipient
        ├── it should decrease claimableFeesAssets by `interest`
        ├── it should emit InterestClaimed with `interest`
        └── it should return `interest`
    └── when interest equals claimableFeesAssets
        ├── given caller is owner
        │   ├── it should mint full claimableFeesAssets to feeRecipient
        │   ├── it should set claimableFeesAssets to zero
        │   ├── it should emit InterestClaimed with full amount
        │   └── it should return full amount
        └── given caller is feeRecipient
            ├── it should mint full claimableFeesAssets to feeRecipient
            ├── it should set claimableFeesAssets to zero
            ├── it should emit InterestClaimed with full amount
            └── it should return full amount